  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gisuma Coffee Processing and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture - Coffee Production and Processing, Beneficiaries: Coffee Farmers , Summary: The project funds will be used to construct a modern coffee washing station and storage facility, purchase a coffee pulping machine and processing equipment, establish a rotating crop purchase fund, hire qualified technical staff, provide training on processing techniques and the coffee value chain, provide training on financial management, monitoring and evaluation, and cover initial project administrative costs.</narrative>
  </description>
